        <p class="section-desc">Real experience in government, healthcare, and enterprise environments.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonials-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);">
        <div class="testimonial-card reveal">
          <div class="testimonial-quote">Government infrastructure deployment for Stanislaus Regional Housing Authority — network security, IT systems, and ongoing support for housing authority operations.</div>
          <div class="testimonial-meta">
            <div class="testimonial-author">Stanislaus Regional Housing Authority</div>
            <div class="testimonial-role">Government Infrastructure</div>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial-verified">✓ Government</div>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-card reveal">
          <div class="testimonial-quote">EHR deployment across 3,500+ computers for Kaiser Permanente. HIPAA compliance implementation, Cerner and Meditech system integration, and healthcare IT support.</div>
          <div class="testimonial-meta">
            <div class="testimonial-author">Kaiser Permanente</div>
            <div class="testimonial-role">Healthcare EHR Deployment</div>
          </div>
